# Windsurf — AI Engineering Harness

Entrypoint: `.ai-harness/AGENTS.md`

- Runtime: `.ai-harness/Runtime/`
- Workflows: feature | bug | refactoring | migration
- Knowledge + Specification/features/<id>/
- Agents: architect, developer, reviewer, tester
- Tools + Governance/permissions.md (`auto` | `ask` | `deny`)

Spec before code. Code and tests always by feature (`.ai-harness/Knowledge/Standards.md`). OSS-first (`Governance/cost.md`). Acceptance = AC-T* or AC-G* + stub. No commit/push/secrets without matrix + explicit ask.
